m morph NotSupported, wall8/buoy embedded decode+resolve, market8 embedded vis); 18 new synthetic facts in NifAnimationImporterTests (all failure rows + BoolData constant form + verbatim fallback + texture-transform decode) 49/49 in class; Nif non-interactive 201/201 (three stale pre-C4e expectations updated: normal-less now parses, transform now decodes, unknown-type fixture moved to NiParticlesData); full non-interactive gate 1589+324+53 green (7 environmental exclusions); dotnet format and brace check clean.
